WEBVTT

00:01:57.319 --> 00:02:00.089
as well as the Fourteenth 
and Fifteenth Amendments,

00:02:00.089 --> 00:02:03.309
only passed after a bloody civil war.

00:02:03.309 --> 00:02:05.915
Ratifying amendments 
has also become harder

00:02:05.915 --> 00:02:09.193
as the country has grown larger
and more diverse.

00:02:09.193 --> 00:02:11.158
The first ever proposed amendment,

00:02:11.158 --> 00:02:13.765
a formula to assign 
congressional representatives,

00:02:13.765 --> 00:02:17.181
was on the verge of ratification
in the 1790s.

00:02:17.181 --> 00:02:20.135
However, as more and more states
joined the union,

00:02:20.135 --> 00:02:24.414
the number needed to reach 
the three-quarter mark increased as well,

00:02:24.414 --> 00:02:27.187
leaving it unratified to this day.

00:02:27.187 --> 00:02:29.383
Today, there are many 
suggested amendments,

00:02:29.383 --> 00:02:31.694
including outlawing 
the burning of the flag,